        "slc_716e3a8d5d56527f211f6d0d918fb5580c8481d97f5003237e10725a123cb8f6"
      ],
      "text": "The project is organized into four pillars: Ingest, Reason, Generate, and Orchestrate, with example modules such as cleanse_text.py, classify_tone.py, repurpose_content.py, and workflow_runner.py."
    },
